&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As part of our Data and Analytics team, you will design, develop, and operate the systems that ingest, process, store, and serve data at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
